,\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man specializing in debunking paranormal occurrences checks into the fabled room 1408 at the Dolphin Hotel. Soon after settling in, he confronts genuine terror.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1086747,\"title\":\"The Watchers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vZVEUPychdvZLrTNwWErr9xZFmu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whnFKx0Y54Ktg6o2TiwbnQfXdZf.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young artist gets stranded in an extensive, immaculate forest in western Ireland, where, after finding shelter, she becomes trapped alongside three strangers, stalked by mysterious creatures each night.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49730,\"title\":\"Red Riding Hood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ixQYkLeLlTTnAoT32dukndyObB6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r4A5SQSGTfleodMm45w7MJgE2WF.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Valerie is in love with a brooding outsider, Peter, but her parents have arranged for her to marry another man. Unwilling to lose each other, Valerie and Peter plan to run away together when Valerie's older sister is killed by a werewolf that prowls the dark forest surrounding their village. Panic grips the town as Valerie discovers that she has a unique connection to the beast--one that inexorably draws them together, making her both suspect ... and bait.\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10185,\"title\":\"The Midnight Meat Train\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5YbfyUA8huK0shr008xwzNVJ5Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tcV7eCdGFN3RzB2ByWRrH5Xf7cU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A photographer's obsessive pursuit of dark subject matter leads him into the path of a serial killer who stalks late night commuters, ultimately butchering them in the most gruesome ways.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463821,\"title\":\"The House with a Clock in Its Walls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qM66Hv4ByAxnilr0jaqCA9uOD4Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQvvRReWhrXnj28s4AIp2PblByg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When ten-year-old Lewis is suddenly orphaned, he is sent to live with his Uncle Jonathan in a creaky (and creepy) old mansion with a mysterious ticking noise that emanates from the walls. Upon discovering that his uncle is a warlock, Lewis begins learning magic, but when he rebelliously resurrects an evil warlock he must find the secret of the house and save the world from destruction.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":539537,\"title\":\"Fantasy Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ZMrZGGW65ePWIgRn1260nA1uUm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dzfiE2VHY362dGI62XfZ2iI87CT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of contest winners arrive at an island hotel to live out their dreams, only to find themselves trapped in nightmare scenarios.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":409297,\"title\":\"A Dark Song\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fguce8M1bZnWjVkRWCFh9P3kt6A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgOwcK8H9cYiPWKhGxAy7EBLaKU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A determined young woman and a damaged occultist risk their lives and souls to perform a dangerous ritual that will grant them what they want.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":928480,\"title\":\"Monster Summer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zD2UZkh0DwbDEMuOKIR7jgwgulZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sJL9R7V1VZcB7i6so6zrQSfYrWa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a mysterious force begins to disrupt their big summer fun, Noah and his friends team up with a retired police detective to embark on a monstrous adventure to save their island.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299824,\"title\":\"Mojin: The Lost Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us0mTpTmGCDboPpgddjcw6nYPQH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9694,\"title\":\"One Missed Call\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ujSEEePCVMyi7Mt1RQMXd6SWmy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/An28cWCkn3S9JPSFaf0FADFenUH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"People mysteriously start receiving voicemail messages from their future selves, in the form of the sound of them reacting to their own violent deaths, along with the exact date and time of their future death, listed on the message log. The plot thickens as the surviving characters pursue the answers to this mystery which could save their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1353117,\"title\":\"Home Sweet Home: Rebirth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9rCBCm9cyI4JfLEhx3EncyncMR3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wmqpE7p2dUCEgCnovuovoNXaCXr.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a city is overrun with a demonically-possessed crowd, a cop